       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. AMOUNT-CHECK.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-AMOUNT PIC 9(08) VALUE 250.
       01  WS-LIMIT  PIC 9(08) VALUE 100.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF WS-AMOUNT > WS-LIMIT
               DISPLAY "OVER-LIMIT"
           ELSE
               DISPLAY "WITHIN-LIMIT"
           END-IF
           GOBACK.

